@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #235573
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF4F8
title UC16 - Produce Management Reports - SSD\nVõ Tấn Tài - 524H0126
actor Manager
participant "SaigonBite System" as System

Manager -> System: listAvailableReports()
alt authorized
  System --> Manager: permittedReportTypesAndFilters
  Manager -> System: produceReport(reportType, period, scope)
  alt invalid filters or unauthorized scope
    System --> Manager: validationError / accessDenied
  else retrieval or aggregation failure
    System --> Manager: reportUnavailable(reason)
  else no eligible records
    System --> Manager: noData(reportType, period, scope)
  else incomplete source data
    System --> Manager: incompleteOrUnavailable(dataStatus)
  else valid and complete result
    System --> Manager: report(values, type, period, scope, dataStatus)
  end
else unauthorized
  System --> Manager: accessDenied
end

note over Manager,System
  Candidate types: sales, hub workload, delivery performance.
  KPI formulas, period, access scope, and data-quality policy:
  Proposed / To Confirm (Workbook Q5 / A-05).
  Report generation is read-only.
end note
footer AI-assisted draft; student review required before submission
@enduml
